---
layout: base.njk
title: "Blog | damirbuilds"
description: "Notes on speed, follow-up, and growth: practical writing on lead response, automation, and what actually moves revenue."
permalink: "index.html"
---
<header class="blog-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">From the blog</span>
    <h1 class="blog-headline">Notes on leads, automation, and revenue.</h1>
    <p class="blog-sub">Practical writing on lead response and automation — what actually moves revenue, not novelty.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="blog-list">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if posts.length > 0 %}
    <div class="post-grid">
      {% for post in posts %}
      <a class="post-card" href="/blog/{{ post.slug }}/">
        {% if post.imageUrl %}
        <img class="post-card-img" src="{{ post.imageUrl }}" alt="{{ post.mainImageAlt or post.title }}" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="675">
        {% else %}
        <div class="post-card-img"></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="post-card-body">
          <div class="post-card-date">{{ post.publishedAt | readableDate }}{% if post.readingTime %} · {{ post.readingTime }} min read{% endif %}</div>
          <h3>{{ post.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.excerpt }}</p>
          <span class="post-card-arrow">Read the post <span>→</span></span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="blog-state">New posts are on the way — check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
